SUMMARY:Living Luxe Design Show 2026\, presented by JennAir
DESCRIPTION:Canada’s premier luxury design and lifestyle event\, bringing together the country’s leading home builders\, designers\, architects\, artists\, and premium brands under one roof. \nDates & Location: \nApril 16–19\, 2026 | Toronto Congress Centre – North Building\, Halls H & I \nOverview: \nThe Living Luxe Design Show 2026 transcends the traditional trade show format\, offering a fully immersive\, multi-sensory experience that blends interior design\, fashion\, art\, hospitality\, and thought leadership. Over four days\, attendees will explore visionary environments\, curated installations\, and cutting-edge concepts that reflect the future of luxury living. \nHighlights Include: \n\nImmersive and visionary installations by Max Jamali\, and custom art experiences by Amer SM\nFashion runway experience presented by the Toronto Fashion Academy\, featuring international designers and daily runway shows\nEmerging Designers Area: Sponsored by Lawrence Park Developments in collaboration with Amanda Aerin\, this immersive\, conversation-sparking installation delivers the show’s most memorable visual experience while hosting six emerging designers. Each creates a Rome-inspired booth\, competing for the Best Emerging Design award and the chance to win a full booth at the 2027 show.\nRosarium Café: A refined luxury lounge with curated seating\, florals\, live music\, custom art\, and photo moments\nOpening Night Launch (Thursday\, April 16 | 7PM–11PM): Exclusive evening event with premium bar experiences\nCity Couture Lumière-Rose (Friday\, April 17 | 6PM–10PM): Supporting Autism in Mind and SickKids Foundation\nLiving Luxe Awards (Saturday\, April 18 | 7PM-11PM): Attendee-voted Best Booth Awards hosted at Liberty Grand\nLuxe Conference (Sunday\, April 19 | 11AM–6PM)\n\nWho Should Attend: \nHomeowners\, design enthusiasts\, and industry professionals seeking inspiration\, innovation\, and connection within Canada’s luxury design community. \nTickets: \n$8–$50 | 1–3 day passes available for kids\, seniors\, and adults \nProduced by Amber Walker Events\, the Living Luxe Design Show continues to elevate Canada’s luxury design scene\, offering a platform for visionary exhibitors\, immersive experiences\, and unforgettable moments.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/living-luxe-design-show-2026-presented-by-jennair/
LOCATION:Toronto Congress Centre\, 650 Dixon Rd\, Etobicoke\, ON M9W 1J1\, Canada\, Etobicoke\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M9W 1J1
CATEGORIES:Art & Design
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/living-luxe-design-show-2026-presented-by-jennair.jpg
END:VEVENT
