SUMMARY:Snacks & Science 
DESCRIPTION:Living with chronic pain can impact many aspects of daily life\, but with the right tools and knowledge\, it’s possible to better manage symptoms and stay active. \nJoin us for Snacks & Science: Living Well with Chronic Pain\, a free community session featuring Dr. Luciana Macedo. This session will cover the science behind pain\, practical tips for managing symptoms\, and ways to stay active while caring for your body. \nConnect with others\, ask questions\, and enjoy light refreshments in a welcoming environment. \nRegistration is required due to limited space.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/snacks-science/
LOCATION:188 Carlton St.\, 188 Carlton St.\, Toronto\, ON M5A 2K8\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5A 2K8
CATEGORIES:Fitness & Wellness,Talks & Panels
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/snacks-science.png
END:VEVENT
