SUMMARY:OSCAR
DESCRIPTION:When wealthy industrialist Bertrand Barnier learns that his employee\, Christian Martin\, has embezzled millions\, Christian offers his boss a trade: have the money returned\, but only if Barnier grants him a massive raise… and his daughter’s hand in marriage! Things quickly spiral out of control for Barnier in this timeless French masterpiece of frantic energy. OSCAR proves that nothing is simple when it comes to family and fortune. (Note: Show has been translated to English for Toronto audiences for the first time!) 
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/oscar/
LOCATION:Tranzac Club\, 292 Brunswick Ave\, Toronto\, M5S 2M7
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Opera
