SUMMARY:Carlos Vives tribute
DESCRIPTION:A special tribute to Carlos Vives\, the artist who brought vallenato and the sound of Colombia to the world. \nA night to sing from the heart.  \nLet’s celebrate the music that has made us dance\, fall in love\, and feel the rhythm. \nGet ready to sing at the top of your lungs\, dance all night\, and relive songs that have become part of history. \nOne night\, countless unforgettable songs\, and all the energy! \nDon’t miss out… it will be a night to remember!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/carlos-vives-tribute/
LOCATION:Lula Lounge\, 1585 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, M6K 1T9
